{
  "info": {
    "name": "Nearby Teacher — Teacher Profile and Geography APIs (Mock Responses)",
    "description": "Focused collection with saved mock response examples. In Postman, import this latest JSON, expand Teacher > Profile, then select the example under a request to view its saved response. Geography lookup examples are under Common. Set baseUrl and, for Teacher requests, a verified teacher bearer token.",
